","summary":"中国央行10月末黄金储备增至7830万盎司，环比增持83万盎司，连续24个月扩储。官方储备资产规模环比下降119亿美元，主要因黄金估值缩水。全球央行三季度净增持黄金321吨，同比增长42%，创2024年Q4以来新高。中国增持步伐与全球趋势一致，反映投资组合多元化和风险管理需求","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785426","publishedAt":"2026-11-07T02:53:52.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"bacsq70v24sj1gd62nxxapayq"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":"lc03hzzlc01z7vdahr2bsm6ou","title":"深交所修订创业板指数编制方案：单只样本股权重上限逐步调整至15%","summary":"深交所宣布将创业板指数单只样本股权重上限逐步调整至15%，调整机制为每次定期调整时若权重超过14.5%则加0.5%向上取整，生效时间为2026年12月14日。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1345,202611063924964937.html","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T11:16:24.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":"pwe9vwp331kjrt01vt2cj1fgv","title":"莫德纳第三季度营收同比增长29%超预期，上调全年增长指引至15%-25%","summary":"莫德纳第三季度营收同比增长29%至13.1亿美元，净利润达1.62亿美元，上调全年营收增长指引至15%-25%。公司披露次世代新冠mRNA疫苗和流感疫苗已获美国FDA批准，并与英国、加拿大、澳大利亚及墨西哥签订长期合作协议，同时研发费用同比下降27%。个性化癌症疫苗intismeran联合默克KEYTRUDA的三期临床数据显示复发风险降低42%，公司正推进监管申报。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785389","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T13:04:34.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":11,"firstPartyEvents":7},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-11-07","next":"2026-11-09"}